 href=\"https://github.com/PatataProjects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ссылка на Github</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.kinetichosting.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:837px\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1133727001254039604/1470852110114357412/image.png?ex=698ec786&is=698d7606&hm=7ea2cfa9fafc9329f96c2ccf0370b9439dbd5abe9098be57dc7218c0694a734e&=&format=webp&quality=lossless\" alt=\"Image\"></a></p>",
